#: umc/js/udm.js:490
msgid "<p><b>Add and modify are disabled in this session.</b></p><p>You have too many user accounts for your license. Carry out the following steps to re-enable editing:</p><ol><li>Disable or delete user accounts</li><li>Re-login to UMC for changes to take effect</li></ol><p>If a new license is needed, contact your UCS partner.</p>"
msgstr "<p><b>此工作階段中已停用新增與修改。</b></p><p>您的使用者帳號數量超過授權允許的上限。請執行下列步驟以重新啟用編輯:</p><ol><li>停用或刪除使用者帳號</li><li>重新登入 UMC 以使變更生效</li></ol><p>若需要新授權，請聯絡您的 UCS 合作夥伴。</p>"

